1
00:00:01,890 --> 00:00:06,510
You can share your own strategies in the Marketplace.

2
00:00:06,610 --> 00:00:11,180
In ActFX, click New to start a strategy.

3
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:16,230
From Template gives you a working starting point.

4
00:00:16,330 --> 00:00:22,250
Name it and pick a template, here RSI Reversal.

5
00:00:22,350 --> 00:00:30,960
Create opens it in the Editor. Change it and test it until you're happy.

6
00:00:31,060 --> 00:00:34,520
To share it, right-click it and choose Publish to Marketplace.

7
00:00:34,620 --> 00:00:45,400
Fill in the name traders will see as the author, and a short summary.

8
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:48,160
Pick a category and the symbols it suits.

9
00:00:48,260 --> 00:00:52,420
Choose a price. A free strategy can be added by anyone, who can also see its code.

10
00:00:52,520 --> 00:00:59,310
Click Publish. The app checks the listing and runs a short back-test first.

11
00:01:03,770 --> 00:01:15,990
When the checks pass, it is live in the Marketplace, and ActFX marks it Published.

12
00:01:16,090 --> 00:01:20,250
My Listings shows everything you've published and whether it's live.

13
00:01:20,350 --> 00:01:26,170
Edit listing changes its text and price without sending new code.

14
00:01:26,270 --> 00:01:32,590
Unpublish takes it down. Copies traders already made stay with them.

